  "worked_solution": "We have $\\frac{1}{7}$ on the left and $\\frac{3}{7}$ on the right.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129500/assets/924b698fde2a2e1c3a43fb8146dcd54074410e3bddba186ca7d48afa5b247a9d.png)\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{7}\\times 3=\\frac{3}{7}.\n$$",
